<title>USA: Steve Madden January same store sales up.</title>
<headline>Steve Madden January same store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>LONG ISLAND CITY, N.Y 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steve Madden Ltd said Tuesday that same-store sales for the month of January increased 44 percent, to $297,200 from $206,100 a year ago.</p>
<p>The company said 1996 unaudited fourth-quarter revenues rose to $16.3 million from $13.2 million a year earlier, and unaudited full-year revenues increased to $45.9 million from $38.7 million in 1995. Both 1996 figures exceeded plan, it said.</p>
<p>The company said it expects final 1996 year-end and fourth-quarter results to be reported early in March.</p>
</text>
